      "handle": "travel-portable-mini-juice-blender",
      "body_html": "<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Travel-Friendly Bottle</strong> — The compact bottle design is built for carrying in a bag or backpack, so smoothies and shakes can be made away from the kitchen.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Clear Blending Cup</strong> — A clear cup with a secure lid lets you watch the blend and keep the contents contained while moving.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Loop Carry Handle</strong> — A loop handle makes the bottle easy to pick up and carry by hand between uses.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft Fruit Blends</strong> — It handles soft fruits, smoothies, shakes and mixed drinks for quick everyday drinks.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Rinse Clean</strong> — The bottle is simple to clean after everyday use, so it is ready for the next blend.</li>\n</ul>\n<p> </p>",
